  "reflectionText": "The Levites lifted up the song of the Sabbath day: it is good to give thanks to the Lord. The righteous shall flourish like the palm tree, planted in the Lord's house. What is it to set aside a day in the week for the thanks you keep forgetting to give on the rest of the days?"
